[{"client_msg_id":"61e28c44-9eea-4001-a8ce-d170ae007a43","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"お茶類のカフェインはコーヒーよりも効果が弱いのよね。タンニンと結合しちゃうから。","ts":"1633243908.420500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ep/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9f8be0b-cc0e-4a44-94b6-01f7b0a70cc1","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私も最近よく紅茶飲むんですけど、カフェイン摂りすぎてないかは気にしてますねー。人によって許容量とか違うのかなあとか","ts":"1633242164.419800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sB1u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33bef77b-46a6-421f-97b4-f582c6ab3492","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"塩分に関しては大丈夫なんですね、良心的だ","ts":"1633232270.417200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nh1G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1935e7b6-07f6-46a9-aed6-af444835b061","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ラーメン (糖質と脂質)","ts":"1633232256.416800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":3,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U81LLJ340","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Ar"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1661c43c-21bd-455b-9b5f-376584e4c208","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":hiee:","ts":"1633232248.416500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r1a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a82f27dd-dad3-46bd-92b3-ff58bf36ac86","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"痛くないときは全く痛くないので不摂生してしまう。。(さてラーメン食いに行くか。)","ts":"1633232239.416200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2fqV9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97a73569-f92e-48b4-a908-a2fc9e23a08c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"そう。複合的過ぎてなにも分からない。。\n体からのフィードバックが半年に一回の痛風発作なので、「こいつ..!報告下手か...!?」ってなります (痛い。動けない。)","ts":"1633232184.415800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hge"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba6d6d91-61f5-413d-b717-650cfdadc4e8","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"安心して干し椎茸食べよう (プリン体がすさまじい量入ってる)","ts":"1633232139.415000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FfFE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91101025-78f8-49c6-909f-2e29d5c71a82","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"糖質自体がアウトなのか、厳しい","ts":"1633232137.414800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k8UE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e57de42e-e926-49d1-aa4b-8d05918ec245","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"完全に理解した","ts":"1633232094.414200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a6q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b39de51e-10e3-4bef-ae44-8891cb4c3945","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://kenko.sawai.co.jp/prevention/201805.html\u003e\n• 糖質 -\u0026gt; 脂肪 -\u0026gt; 尿酸値\n• 動物性由来のプリン体\n• アルコール + プリン体 -\u0026gt; 尿酸値up\n• カロリー -\u0026gt; 脂肪 -\u0026gt; 尿酸値","ts":"1633232092.413800","attachments":[{"fallback":"痛風 | 病気と医療の知って得する豆知識 | サワイ健康推進課","id":1,"title":"痛風 | 病気と医療の知って得する豆知識 | サワイ健康推進課","title_link":"https://kenko.sawai.co.jp/prevention/201805.html","text":"文字通り、風が吹くだけで痛いといわれる痛風。主に女性より尿酸濃度の高い男性に発症することが多い病気です。耐え難い痛みになる前に、生活習慣や食生活を改善することをお勧めします。本記事では尿酸値を下げる方法を紹介。日々の生活習慣を要チェック！","image_url":"https://kenko.sawai.co.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/thumb_middle-prevention201805.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"kenko.sawai.co.jp","service_icon":"https://kenko.sawai.co.jp/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://kenko.sawai.co.jp/prevention/201805.html","original_url":"https://kenko.sawai.co.jp/prevention/201805.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q5T9A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1bc0ccf-1e1e-4c9a-8a04-6b4e019f13ac","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"通風の要因は結構複合的らしいですね、詳しくないのでちょっと気になってきました","ts":"1633231987.412700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+lZM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1b83636-24e3-4c56-b6fa-697cf6fe1002","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(\u003chttps://espressocoffeeguide.com/how-much-caffeine-in-a-cup-of-coffee/\u003e ぐぐってもこういう全く関係ない情報ばかりみつかる...)","ts":"1633231857.411900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Espresso \u0026amp; Coffee Guide: How Much Caffeine in a Cup of Coffee? - Espresso \u0026amp; Coffee Guide","id":1,"title":"How Much Caffeine in a Cup of Coffee? - Espresso \u0026amp; Coffee Guide","title_link":"https://espressocoffeeguide.com/how-much-caffeine-in-a-cup-of-coffee/","text":"Caffeine in Coffee Depends on a Number of Factors Have you ever wondered precisely how much caffeine is in that cup of coffee or espresso you are","fields":[{"title":"Est. reading time","value":"7 minutes","short":true}],"blocks":null,"service_name":"Espresso \u0026amp; Coffee Guide","service_icon":"https://espressocoffeeguide.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://espressocoffeeguide.com/how-much-caffeine-in-a-cup-of-coffee/","original_url":"https://espressocoffeeguide.com/how-much-caffeine-in-a-cup-of-coffee/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UhSa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"835c85cc-994c-4a16-846a-f379ce0100b8","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"豆1gに対してカフェインの量どのくらいが抽出されているかのデータ知りたい","ts":"1633231839.411600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rnQKh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7715de3-5257-47a2-9ff0-a9c27e547009","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"痛風は多分カフェイン関係なくて単に糖分の取りすぎかなと。","ts":"1633231777.411200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c8E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b076524-01e4-477f-9f1a-934043a2efd4","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"pourover","ts":"1633231743.411000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Hp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1eb896b8-b31e-4476-b7a3-c1ea328a1b74","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そうかカフェインもプリン体だから痛風の原因になるのか","ts":"1633231739.410800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wBP1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11fbf5db-5cf3-4885-bc12-8c3585990022","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"コーヒーはmedium roastの豆25gを夫婦ふたりでわってるので僕単体で12.5g相当です。","ts":"1633231735.410600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H=sKr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae027684-53d0-4a93-8ed8-1080114b4de6","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"カフェインも大学受験のときはエスタロンモカを飲んでましたね。やばかった。","ts":"1633231723.409900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a/j00"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ee822dd-7414-47ff-b886-a92a3d51b728","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ちなみ補足すると僕は毎日ぴったり一杯のんでました。あと日によって紅茶1~2胚も追加で。 \u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01BXG2FGD8/p1633222017399400\u003e","ts":"1633231712.409400","attachments":[{"fallback":"[October 2nd, 2021 5:46 PM] u: ここ最近毎日コーヒー飲んでたので、今日はノーカフェインの日にして休ませてる。すでに頭痛してきた・・・","id":1,"author_id":"U03C4RC8X","author_name":"ujihisa","author_subname":"ujihisa","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U03C4RC8X","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d9d0ceb387e3b6de5c4562af78e8a910.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0004-48.png","text":"ここ最近毎日コーヒー飲んでたので、今日はノーカフェインの日にして休ませてる。すでに頭痛してきた・・・","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #life-healthcare","ts":1633222017.399400,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.c