 302: Speculative Life (hak)","title_link":"https://rebuild.fm/302/","text":"Hakuro Matsuda さんをゲストに迎えて、チップ、キーボード、ブロックチェーン、マンガ、映画、AI などについて話しました。","thumb_url":"https://cdn.rebuild.fm/images/icon240.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Rebuild","service_icon":"https://rebuild.fm/favicon.ico","thumb_width":240,"thumb_height":240,"from_url":"https://rebuild.fm/302/","original_url":"https://rebuild.fm/302/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CdbFH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EADF5381-A179-4A23-94A1-1085A394C0AB","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"コーヒーは飲み過ぎると頭痛と吐き気がするようになりましたね\n1日1ドリップ(500mlくらい)が自分には適量","ts":"1633229337.403000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EIlDz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d879d10-d3e2-4adc-8e58-5df97272a73d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"私は耐性ないので全然コーヒー飲めない","ts":"1633229219.401100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"151To"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7f1a0b2-3007-4d3a-87d9-c6a825f2f83b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なんやかんやで薬物ですからね","ts":"1633229205.400300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jouI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07cec708-8c31-40cd-9b35-39e1f839639d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"急にコーヒー飲まなくなると頭痛するらしいですね。Rebuildでもそんな話があったような。","ts":"1633228816.399900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aDKI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca6bfe75-f083-453f-8076-2ef606d613e1","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ここ最近毎日コーヒー飲んでたので、今日はノーカフェインの日にして休ませてる。すでに頭痛してきた・・・","ts":"1633222017.399400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"odaijini","count":5,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U017BU3UZBQ","U011FTGJ3SN","U0